DROP SCHEMA sm7 CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 5 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to table sm7.a
drop cascades to table sm7.k
drop cascades to table sm7.r
drop cascades to function sm7.f(integer)
drop cascades to table sm7.p
